1a:["$","p",null,{"children":"用少量包含思考、动作与观察的示例，对冻结 model 进行 prompting。动作调用任务接口获取结果，文字 reasoning 用于分解目标、提炼观察和修订计划；持续追加的任务 context 连接这些步骤，直至作答或完成环境任务。"}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]
1c:["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原文在 ALFWorld 中使用把纸张放到台灯下检查等任务。输入目标与环境描述，Thought 将目标拆为找到纸张和台灯；Action 导航、拿取和使用，Observation 更新物品位置与动作结果；Agent 据此继续行动直到完成。输出是实际动作轨迹与任务结果，没有将本次经验写入下一任务的训练步骤。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"将原动作空间 A 扩成 A∪L，L 表示语言 Thought。环境动作改变外部状态并产生 Observation；Thought 只更新当前 Context。这是一个清楚的形式化区别：Context 变长能改变当前策略输入，却不自动形成持久系统更新。论文主要通过 Prompt 和实验展示效果，无通用收敛保证。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"Â = A ∪ L\nThought: context_(t+1) = (context_t, thought_t)\nAction: environment → observation_(t+1)"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Reasoning 与 Acting 的结合是否互补？→ Experiment：在问答、事实验证、ALFWorld 与 WebShop 比较 CoT、Act-only 和 ReAct 等设置。→ Answer：作者报告多场景收益，也指出检索和推理会相互影响；并非每个任务都由同一种方式最好解决。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者在问答、事实核验、文本环境和网页操作任务中报告有效性，并分析相对仅 reasoning 或仅行动的差异。主实验是 few-shot prompting 执行，成绩反映当次任务求解能力，而非多轮自主更新后的通用能力增长。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"ReAct 让信息获取和决策连接起来。分析它时应检查工具返回了什么，以及 Thought 是否确实利用了这些证据；轨迹可读不等于所有推理都忠实。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是 Agent 能正确解释 Observation。工具结果可能不完整，Model 也可能忽略结果继续执行原计划，形成看似有反馈却没有实质纠正的循环。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"核心 prompt 范式没有持久学习模块，也不要求修改 model parameters、prompt optimization 器或自身代码。论文另有初步 fine-tuning 实验，但不能因此把主方法的每次观察都说成参数学习，或把任务内重规划称为 Recursive Self-Improvement。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：建立一个有 Search、Lookup、Finish 的小型知识环境。Day 3–5：比较 CoT、Act-only 与交替轨迹，保持调用上限一致。Day 6–7：加入缺失页面与冲突信息，检查成功率和证据使用情况。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"让工具返回一条明确反驳初始猜测的事实。如果 Agent 在 Thought 中提到它却仍输出原结论，就能将“看到证据”与“根据证据改变决策”区分开。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究 Observation 的实际因果作用：对相同任务替换关键工具返回，测后续行动是否按证据变化，并训练能识别何时需要新信息的控制器。目标是信息获取策略的可验证性，而非把 Thought 写得更长。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
